   "line": [
    "h4"
   ],
   "spoken": "Don't take the bishop yet — squeeze more first. The attacking idea is to blast open the h-file with h4 and h5, straight at his king. We don't even bother stopping his queenside expansion; we go for the throat.",
   "kind": "plan",
   "teaches": [
